; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180 wave 1A; REBUILT sl-0187+0188): Sine Shoal
; — grade 2, void pool. PLACEHOLDER id. BEHAVIOURAL family
; (sl-0188): FLANKER — the shoal WEAVES: spirals to band and
; circle-strafes while the sine bolts snake, phase speeds climb
; 2.4/2.7/3.2 (never a CHASER — the one-room corner-trap law
; holds). P2 ITERATED under never-weaken: sine 58t / speed 2.7 /
; entry beat 40 — a byte-identical cap-lane graze (FIRST@576 x3
; seeds) rode the FROZEN entry-beat firing position; only the
; longer beat (more telegraph, never less) moved it. Every number
; [T].
; hp 700 = 35s at the g2 spine (sl-0187: 20-60s INTENSE; cooldowns
; compressed ~x0.7). One lead per pattern; elite amber; every
; number [T]; GATE 7 owns the length.

